Full text: https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

Sources (each under its own license):
  - Wikidata — CC0-1.0
  - GeoNames — CC-BY-4.0

Obligations when you redistribute this dataset or anything derived from it:
  - Attribution is required. Keep the `attribution` field of manifest.json with the data.
  - No Share-Alike. You may license derived works as you like, subject to the line above.
  - Ship the canonical license text (see the URL above) alongside any redistribution.

This dataset holds records from ONE license family only. Loqi Places never merges
license families into one file: the boundary of a source is the boundary of a dataset.
